{"product_id":"the-secret-lee-child-andrew-child","title":"The Secret – Lee Child \u0026 Andrew Child","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"365\"\u003eThere are two kinds of secrets in the world: the ones you tell after a glass of wine, and the ones you take to the grave. Unfortunately for Jack Reacher, he’s stumbled onto the second kind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"710\"\u003eIt’s 1992, and Reacher is still wearing the U.S. Army badge. But when word comes down about a hush-hush assignment involving the deaths of several seemingly unconnected people, he discovers what no one else is willing to admit: someone, somewhere, is tying up loose ends—and the bodies are piling higher than the official reports would like.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1145\"\u003eThis isn’t a puzzle you solve with paperwork. This is the kind you solve with grit, muscle, and that trademark Reacher intuition—the one that can spot trouble from a hundred yards away. Together with a handful of equally wary allies, he begins peeling back the layers of conspiracy. Each truth he uncovers only leads to a darker question: who wants these people dead, and what’s so dangerous that it’s worth killing to keep hidden?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1357\"\u003eThe Secret is classic Reacher: razor-sharp, relentless, and brimming with moral tension. Lee Child and Andrew Child deliver the pace of a thriller with the weight of a secret that could change everything.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1386\"\u003eAuthors: Lee Child, Andrew Child\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1465\"\u003eFormat:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1465\"\u003ePages: 416\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003ePublisher: \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1544\"\u003eISBN: 9781984818576\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1587\"\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45656455217305,"sku":"5RG9781984818576","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/91XptTVwDIL.jpg?v=1755680819","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-secret-lee-child-andrew-child","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}